{"title": "Elixir of Bloodlust (Action) (Condition)", "pageid": 58520, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Elixir_of_Bloodlust_(Action)_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has tick type", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bd/POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bd/POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bd/POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"POT Potion of Vitality Unfaded Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bd/POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/bd/POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Elixir of Bloodlust</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity has entered a murderous state of bloodlust. Once per turn, when it kills an enemy, it gains <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/38px-HP_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"5 temporary hit points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> 5 <a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Temporary Hit Points\">temporary hit points</a> and an <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a>. Replaces effects from other elixirs when drunk. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>UID: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">ALCH_ELIXIR_BLOODLUST_TEMPAP</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ALCH_ELIXIR_BLOODLUST_TEMPAP+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ALCH_ELIXIR_BLOODLUST_TEMPAP+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">ALCH_ELIXIR_BLOODLUST_TEMPAP</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CALCH_ELIXIR_BLOODLUST_TEMPAP%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CALCH_ELIXIR_BLOODLUST_TEMPAP%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Duration\" title=\"Conditions\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Loses duration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Duration\" title=\"Conditions\">Loses duration</a>: start of turn</div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>In Honour Mode, this condition grants an extra action that does not function with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Extra_Attack\" title=\"Extra Attack\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/20px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/30px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/40px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Extra Attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/20px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Extra_Attack\" title=\"Extra Attack\">Extra Attack</a> or any of its variants, similar to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Haste\" title=\"Haste\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Haste_Icon.webp/20px-Haste_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Haste_Icon.webp/30px-Haste_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Haste_Icon.webp/40px-Haste_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Haste\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Haste_Icon.webp/20px-Haste_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/11/Haste_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Haste\" title=\"Haste\">Haste</a> in Honour Mode. On lower difficulties, it grants a regular action.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Elixir_of_Bloodlust\">Sources of Elixir of Bloodlust</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"min-width: 30px;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Bloodlust_(Condition)\" title=\"Elixir of Bloodlust (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bd/POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bd/POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bd/POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Elixir of Bloodlust\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bd/POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bd/POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Bloodlust_(Condition)\" title=\"Elixir of Bloodlust (Condition)\">Elixir of Bloodlust</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714170329\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.065 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.070 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2093/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 27638/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9176/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.034/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1448001/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,t